#indent 4

//: # check/module/memo_trait_public_impl_generic_instantiation
//: public generic trait impl を operation candidate へ[進/すす]める前に、generic instantiation の typed evidence を[検査/けんさ]する checker-layer module です。
//:
//: [目的/もくてき]:
//: - `memo_trait_public_impl_header` は detailed generic binder evidence を header shape へ接続しましたが、generic instantiation、bound solving、substituted target shape が未接続の間は operation candidate 化を拒否しています。
//: - この module は、その次段階として「generic impl を具体型へ instantiate した」と主張するために最低限必要な evidence を 1 record にまとめて検査します。
//: - binder evidence、stable type argument identity、substitution shape evidence、bound solving status を分けて受け取り、count だけや display string だけで accepted path へ進む退行を防ぎます。
//:
//: [契約/けいやく]:
//: - accepted authority は `SelfhostMemoTraitPublicImplGenericInstantiationInput` の typed field だけです。
//: - source text、span、lexeme、display name、diagnostic text、module path、public surface hash、HIR、Resource IR、backend artifact、proof store record は accepted instantiation hash material に入りません。
//: - `generic_binder_evidence.type_parameter_count` と `type_argument_count` は一致しなければなりません。generic parameter 数と具体 type argument 数が一致しない instantiation は存在しないためです。
//: - `type_argument_identity_hash` は既存 `memo_trait_type_argument_identity` が substitution 済み concrete type argument から作った schema 付き stable hash です。hash value だけを authority として扱いません。
//: - substitution 後の target / trait application shape は、`memo_trait_public_impl_generic_substitution_shape` が作った schema 付き evidence からだけ受け取ります。raw `Option i32` を直接渡す API は、任意の nonzero hash を instantiation root へ混ぜられるため受理しません。
//: - instantiation gate は substitution shape producer を無条件には信用せず、schema、root hash、binder count、bound count、binder shape hash、type argument identity、pre-substitution shape、trace shape、substitution traversal の root/output TypeId、step count、step stream hash、substituted shape が input と矛盾しないことを再検査します。
//: - evidence struct は public value として構築可能なので、「producer が返したはず」という事実は型だけでは保証されません。そのため instantiation gate でも component field を再検査し、substitution producer が導出した root hash も field から再計算して照合します。
//: - `target_substitution_root_type_id` などの TypeId field は、同じ checker session 内で substitution traversal evidence と accepted instantiation evidence を結びつける local typed link です。persistent artifact や canonical type identity の authority には使いません。
//: - pre-substitution target / trait application shape が public impl header の original shape と一致するかどうか、substituted output TypeId から canonical type key / final shape hash を作るかどうかは、materializer accepted path へ接続する後続 connector の責務です。この module は binder / type argument identity / substitution evidence / bound solving evidence の同一性に責務を絞ります。
//: - bound count が 0 の場合は `NoBounds` だけを受理します。bound count が 1 以上の場合は `AllSolved(evidence)` が必要で、solver policy hash と proof shape hash が nonzero でなければなりません。
//: - この evidence は generic impl candidate acceptance の前段です。operation classifier、method body purity、Drop no-escape、MemoKey / MemoValue aggregate proof、PrivateCache / PrivateState effect masking、prechecked artifact acceptance は後続 stage が別 evidence として検査します。
//:
//: [現状/げんじょう]:
//: - Phase 1 では solver が返すべき bound solving evidence の shape と、substitution shape producer が消費した substitution traversal evidence を instantiation evidence に残す boundary を固定します。actual trait bound solver、canonical type key projection、coherence checker、materializer への accepted path 接続は後続 slice です。
//: - そのため既存 materializer の `GenericImplInstantiationUnsupported` はこの slice では維持します。この module の成功は、materializer を緩める根拠ではなく、後続接続時に要求する typed evidence contract です。
//:
//: [計算量/けいさんりょう]:
//: - この module 自体は fixed-size evidence を検査して hash に畳み込むだけなので O(1) 時間・O(1) 追加空間です。
//: - type argument identity 作成、substitution shape evidence 作成、bound solving の計算量は、それぞれの producer / solver module の契約に従います。
//:
//: neplg2:test[stdio, normalize_newlines]
//: stdout: mlstr:
//: ##: Checked [ok,ok,ok,ok,ok,ok,ok,ok,ok,ok,ok]
//: ##: [0] ok
//: ##: [1] ok
//: ##: [2] ok
//: ##: [3] ok
//: ##: [4] ok
//: ##: [5] ok
//: ##: [6] ok
//: ##: [7] ok
//: ##: [8] ok
//: ##: [9] ok
//: ##: [10] ok
//: exit_code: 0
//: ```neplg2
//:| #entry main
//:| #target std
//:| #import "core/result" as *
//:| #import "neplg2/core/check/module/memo_trait_public_impl_generic_binder" as *
//:| #import "neplg2/core/check/module/memo_trait_public_impl_generic_instantiation" as *
//:| #import "std/test" as *
//: fn main %impure fn void i32 \void:
//:     let summary selfhost_memo_trait_public_impl_generic_instantiation_stage0
//:     let checks0 checks_new
//:     let checks1 checks_push checks0 check is_ok summary.accepted
//:     let checks2 checks_push checks1 check is_ok summary.no_bounds_accepted
//:     let checks3 checks_push checks2 check selfhost_memo_trait_public_impl_generic_instantiation_error_result_eq summary.type_argument_mismatch SelfhostMemoTraitPublicImplGenericInstantiationErrorKind::TypeArgumentCountMismatch selfhost_memo_trait_public_impl_generic_binder_count_mismatch_new 2 1
//:     let checks4 checks_push checks3 check selfhost_memo_trait_public_impl_generic_instantiation_error_result_eq summary.identity_placeholder SelfhostMemoTraitPublicImplGenericInstantiationErrorKind::TypeArgumentIdentityHashPlaceholder
//:     let checks5 checks_push checks4 check selfhost_memo_trait_public_impl_generic_instantiation_error_result_eq summary.substitution_shape_placeholder SelfhostMemoTraitPublicImplGenericInstantiationErrorKind::SubstitutionShapeHashPlaceholder
//:     let checks6 checks_push checks5 check selfhost_memo_trait_public_impl_generic_instantiation_error_result_eq summary.substitution_binder_hash_mismatch SelfhostMemoTraitPublicImplGenericInstantiationErrorKind::SubstitutionShapeBinderHashMismatch
//:     let checks7 checks_push checks6 check selfhost_memo_trait_public_impl_generic_instantiation_error_result_eq summary.substitution_identity_mismatch SelfhostMemoTraitPublicImplGenericInstantiationErrorKind::SubstitutionShapeTypeArgumentIdentityHashMismatch
//:     let checks8 checks_push checks7 check selfhost_memo_trait_public_impl_generic_instantiation_error_result_eq summary.substitution_target_placeholder SelfhostMemoTraitPublicImplGenericInstantiationErrorKind::SubstitutionShapeTargetTypeShapeHashPlaceholder
//:     let checks9 checks_push checks8 check selfhost_memo_trait_public_impl_generic_instantiation_error_result_eq summary.bound_required SelfhostMemoTraitPublicImplGenericInstantiationErrorKind::BoundSolvingRequired
//:     let checks10 checks_push checks9 check selfhost_memo_trait_public_impl_generic_instantiation_error_result_eq summary.bound_unsolved SelfhostMemoTraitPublicImplGenericInstantiationErrorKind::BoundSolvingUnsolved 1
//:     let checks11 checks_push checks10 check selfhost_memo_trait_public_impl_generic_instantiation_error_result_eq summary.bound_count_mismatch SelfhostMemoTraitPublicImplGenericInstantiationErrorKind::BoundSolvingCountMismatch selfhost_memo_trait_public_impl_generic_binder_count_mismatch_new 1 2
//:     let shown checks_print_report checks11
//:     checks_exit_code shown
//: ```

#import "alloc/hash/hash32" as *
#import "core/math" as *
#import "core/result" as *
#import "core/traits/copy" as *
#import "neplg2/core/ty/ty/id" as *
#import "neplg2/core/ty/ty/memo_trait_type_argument_identity" as *
#import "./memo_trait_public_impl_generic_binder" as *
#import "./memo_trait_public_impl_generic_substitution_shape" as *

//: SelfhostMemoTraitPublicImplGenericBoundSolvingEvidence: generic impl bound solving の typed summary
//:
//: [契約/けいやく]:
//: - `schema_version` は solver evidence の schema です。0 は placeholder として拒否します。
//: - 受理側は `selfhost_memo_trait_public_impl_generic_bound_solving_evidence_schema_version` と一致する schema だけを受理します。
//: - `solved_bound_count` は solver が解決済みとした bound 数です。binder evidence の `type_parameter_bound_count` と一致しなければなりません。
//: - `solver_policy_hash` は solver policy / rule set の typed fingerprint です。表示名ではありません。
//: - `proof_shape_hash` は bound solving が使った typed proof shape です。証明本文や診断文字列ではありません。
pub struct SelfhostMemoTraitPublicImplGenericBoundSolvingEvidence:
    schema_version %i32
    solved_bound_count %i32
    solver_policy_hash %i32
    proof_shape_hash %i32

//: SelfhostMemoTraitPublicImplGenericBoundSolvingStatus: bound solving の状態
//:
//: [目的/もくてき]:
//: - bound が存在しない場合、全て解決済みの場合、未解決の場合を bool ではなく enum で分けます。
pub enum SelfhostMemoTraitPublicImplGenericBoundSolvingStatus:
    NoBounds
    AllSolved %SelfhostMemoTraitPublicImplGenericBoundSolvingEvidence
    Unsolved %i32

//: SelfhostMemoTraitPublicImplGenericInstantiationInput: generic impl instantiation gate の typed input
pub struct SelfhostMemoTraitPublicImplGenericInstantiationInput:
    generic_binder_evidence %SelfhostMemoTraitPublicImplGenericBinderEvidence
    type_argument_count %i32
    type_argument_identity_hash %SelfhostMemoTraitStableTypeArgumentIdentityHash
    substitution_shape_evidence %SelfhostMemoTraitPublicImplGenericSubstitutionShapeEvidence
    bound_solving_status %SelfhostMemoTraitPublicImplGenericBoundSolvingStatus

//: SelfhostMemoTraitPublicImplGenericInstantiationEvidence: accepted generic instantiation evidence
//:
//: [契約/けいやく]:
//: - `instantiation_shape_hash` は nonzero でなければ accepted evidence ではありません。
//: - `generic_binder_shape_hash`、binder parameter / bound table hash、`type_argument_identity_hash`、substitution shape hash、substitution trace shape hash、substitution traversal component、substituted shape hash、bound solution hash は別々の producer 由来の typed material として保持します。
//: - root / output TypeId は canonical type key ではありません。後続の accepted materializer は、persistent authority が必要な段階で別 producer が作る canonical type key / final shape hash を要求します。
pub struct SelfhostMemoTraitPublicImplGenericInstantiationEvidence:
    schema_version %i32
    type_parameter_count %i32
    type_argument_count %i32
    type_parameter_bound_count %i32
    generic_binder_shape_hash %i32
    generic_parameter_table_shape_hash %i32
    generic_bound_table_shape_hash %i32
    type_argument_identity_hash %SelfhostMemoTraitStableTypeArgumentIdentityHash
    substitution_shape_hash %i32
    substitution_trace_shape_hash %i32
    target_substitution_root_type_id %SelfhostTypeId
    target_substitution_output_type_id %SelfhostTypeId
    target_substitution_step_count %i32
    target_substitution_step_stream_hash %i32
    substituted_target_type_shape_hash %i32
    trait_application_substitution_root_type_id %SelfhostTypeId
    trait_application_substitution_output_type_id %SelfhostTypeId
    trait_application_substitution_step_count %i32
    trait_application_substitution_step_stream_hash %i32
    substituted_trait_application_shape_hash %i32
    bound_solution_shape_hash %i32
    instantiation_shape_hash %i32

//: SelfhostMemoTraitPublicImplGenericInstantiationErrorKind: instantiation gate の拒否理由
pub enum SelfhostMemoTraitPublicImplGenericInstantiationErrorKind:
    BinderEvidenceSchemaPlaceholder
    BinderEvidenceHashPlaceholder
    TypeArgumentCountNegative
    TypeArgumentCountMismatch %SelfhostMemoTraitPublicImplGenericBinderCountMismatch
    BinderEvidenceParameterTableHashPlaceholder
    BinderEvidenceBoundTableHashPlaceholder
    TypeArgumentIdentitySchemaPlaceholder
    TypeArgumentIdentityHashPlaceholder
    SubstitutionShapeSchemaPlaceholder
    SubstitutionShapeSchemaMismatch
    SubstitutionShapeHashPlaceholder
    SubstitutionShapeHashMismatch
    SubstitutionShapeTypeParameterCountMismatch %SelfhostMemoTraitPublicImplGenericBinderCountMismatch
    SubstitutionShapeTypeArgumentCountMismatch %SelfhostMemoTraitPublicImplGenericBinderCountMismatch
    SubstitutionShapeTypeParameterBoundCountMismatch %SelfhostMemoTraitPublicImplGenericBinderCountMismatch
    SubstitutionShapeBinderHashMismatch
    SubstitutionShapeTypeArgumentIdentitySchemaPlaceholder
    SubstitutionShapeTypeArgumentIdentityHashPlaceholder
    SubstitutionShapeTypeArgumentIdentitySchemaMismatch
    SubstitutionShapeTypeArgumentIdentityHashMismatch
    SubstitutionShapePreTargetTypeShapeHashPlaceholder
    SubstitutionShapePreTraitApplicationShapeHashPlaceholder
    SubstitutionTraceShapeHashPlaceholder
    SubstitutionShapeTargetRootTypeIdInvalid
    SubstitutionShapeTargetOutputTypeIdInvalid
    SubstitutionShapeTargetStepCountMissing
    SubstitutionShapeTargetStepStreamHashPlaceholder
    SubstitutionShapeTargetTypeShapeHashPlaceholder
    SubstitutionShapeTraitApplicationRootTypeIdInvalid
    SubstitutionShapeTraitApplicationOutputTypeIdInvalid
    SubstitutionShapeTraitApplicationStepCountMissing
    SubstitutionShapeTraitApplicationStepStreamHashPlaceholder
    SubstitutionShapeTraitApplicationShapeHashPlaceholder
    BoundCountNegative
    BoundSolvingRequired
    BoundSolvingUnexpected
    BoundSolvingUnsolved %i32
    BoundSolvingSchemaPlaceholder
    BoundSolvingCountMismatch %SelfhostMemoTraitPublicImplGenericBinderCountMismatch
    BoundSolvingPolicyHashPlaceholder
    BoundSolvingProofShapeHashPlaceholder
    DerivedBoundSolutionShapeHashPlaceholder
    DerivedInstantiationShapeHashPlaceholder

